<title>USA: Javelin Systems Inc files registration.</title>
<headline>Javelin Systems Inc files registration.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Javelin Systems Inc said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed initial public offering of 850,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company also granted underwriters an option to buy an additional 111,250 and 16,250 shares of common stock, respectively, to cover underwriters' overallotments.</p>
<p>The initial public offering price is estimated to be between $5 and $7 per share.  Following the offering, there will be approximately 2,954,250 shares of common stock of Javelin Systems outstanding.</p>
</text>
